    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nThis four bedroom detached cottage, which is conveniently located a short drive from Mulranny village, comes to the market in need of modernisation throughout, but offers an excellent opportunity for a new buyer to put their own stamp on it. \n\nOriginally built in 1920s, the cottage was extended to the rear circa 1996 and a new septic tank was also installed at this time. The cottage requires upgrading which may include improving the insulation and the heating system.\nWe believe the property is eligible for the Vacant homes Refurbishment Grant.\n\nThe floor area measures approximately 85.27 sq m/917.8 sq ft. Accommodation comprises of entrance hall, kitchen, living room with solid fuel stove, two double bedrooms, two single bedrooms and a bathroom. \n\nSite\nThe site measures approximately 0.39 acres with landscaped gardens to the rear. Externally the property is in good condition as it has been well maintained by the current owner.\n\nLocation\nRosturk is 3 km from Mulranny, a charming coastal village who's many amenities include Blue Flag Beach, hotel, primary school, restaurants/bars, shops and nine hole golf course. Westport and Castlebar towns are approximately 20/25 minutes drive and Ireland West Interenational Airport is 80km distance.\n\nDirections: Eircode F28 DR70\nFrom Mulranny village heading in the Newport direction continue for 3.1 km and the property is on the left\n\nOFFERS IN EXCESS OF 185,000"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.4m x 0.91m\nTiled floor\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.02m x 2.48m\nLaminate floor\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.18m x 3.4m\nLaminate Floor\n\nLiving/Dining room - 4.5m x 3.2m\nTiled floor, solid fuel stove, built in storage cupboards\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.3m x 2.8m\nLaminate floor\n\nHall - 1.3m x 1.7m\nTiled floor\n\nKitchen - 4.3m x 2.1m\nTiled floor, kitchen units, breakfast bar, door leading to back garden\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.2m x 3.0m\nLaminate floor, built in wardrobe\n\nBathroom - 2.8m x 2.1m\nTiled floor, Bath, shower, whb\n\n"
